cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MOSAIC — Multi-Omic Sequencing Analysis and Integrated Characterization"
version: 1.1.7
date-released: "2026-08-17"
url: "https://github.com/WalterIrib/MOSAIC"
repository-code: "https://github.com/WalterIrib/MOSAIC"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  MOSAIC is a modular, automated pipeline for comprehensive multi-omic RNA-seq
  analysis. It covers differential gene expression, transposable element
  quantification and locus-level DE, alternative splicing, RNA editing, circRNA
  detection, fusion genes, co-expression networks, and metatranscriptomics.
  Results are delivered as interactive Quarto HTML reports.
keywords:
  - RNA-seq
  - bioinformatics
  - transposable elements
  - alternative splicing
  - RNA editing
  - multi-omics
  - pipeline
